{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：12:20 2026-05-19 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今（19日）早上11時10分，九龍灣宏照道輔警總部對開發生嚴重交通意外，一部白色車身有建築署標誌的私家車撞倒一名過路老婦。老婦傷勢嚴重，昏迷送院搶救；而涉事的私家車肇事後冒煙，警方及消防員到場封路救火及調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"女傷者血流披面送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/779a582204be4184cb3d60755b2b1edc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120651167.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馬路中有火種。fb「突發馬路車cam大全」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/888ea4e3ece64b30f3c2faac1a858933/2026-05/c4ad0424-939b-4d66-b6db-b31859e289d4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場冒出白煙。fb「突發馬路車cam大全」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c04e66cb2aaaa1ba7b9fd4f90689867b/2026-05/4b706fd5-b6dc-454a-8d89-6f594c503ef2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb「突發馬路車cam大全」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f50e1421b572043b171c44af5c759927/2026-05/9f23266e-83a7-4b6b-8b1a-f0ddc7e4a77a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fb「突發馬路車cam大全」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/313f884f07a2ba4bd4e55f82b6fa66f8/2026-05/85e11c35-854f-4e93-ae78-afc79b3b9161.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。fb「突發馬路車cam大全」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6f9ccedbb5a0bb120e0f2c941af3be1/2026-05/b2f48b8a-1e53-4c25-91f3-d4c211d01c43.jpg\"/>\n<p>據了解，建築署私家車撞到老婦後，再撞到食環署監測非法棄置廢物的攝錄系統設施，設施內的電池被撞至飛脫，跌出馬路中央，而私家車再撞向路邊鐵欄始停，私家車車頭撞毀，馬路中遺有一堆火種，並且冒煙。</p>\n<img alt=\"建築署私家車撞毀路邊鐵欄始停。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fc0424a7ed17cdbfe8df6d3adbd7a54/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私家車車頭撞毀。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bedc516775858875ec574dcaa7a8eaf9/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_05.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/043b1489543ca59efe427c5b9de91060/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25678d154f634f83cbe44f15025bfefd/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_12.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/138b87d6a58f0f879f00b046ed4602dd/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"食環署監測非法棄置廢料的儀器被私家車撞毀。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce28fbc08ee13b1fb64deb6524fbd652/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_18.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50fdcf46f0785d41077d1ddbc15a41a1/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9f457972330a0a20e5a8d0b04f366d4/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120920645_27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f92f96a052dca5e557ea72b7489da65/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_120922735.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/966273aafa141eab0a06e722dec77322/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260519_121039058.jpg\"/>\n<p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，啓祥道和宏照道交界的部分行車線仍然封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。 駕駛人士請留意在場警務人員指示，並避免前往有關路段。現時上址交通擠塞。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-19T05:53:53.728850+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}